{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57197","headline":"十四科头 静乱不二 · 宝志","name":"十四科头 静乱不二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"声闻厌喧求静，犹如弃面求饼。\n饼即从来是面，造作随人百变。\n烦恼即是菩提，无心即是无境。\n生死不异湼盘，贪嗔如焰如影。\n智者无心求佛，愚人执邪执正。\n徒劳空过一生，不见如来妙顶。\n了达淫慾性空。\n镬汤鑪炭自冷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宝志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57197.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57197","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}